{"ts":"2026-08-05T20:20:16.290Z","author":"codex-jellyfin-format-20260805","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"1fec629d18c8735ddc6a99ad","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"jf-36oy"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Enforce structured output formats across dedicated Jellyfin commands"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Replace TOON-only command output paths with the shared typed formatter so every advertised format remains syntactically valid and schema-consistent across read and mutation command families, while preserving TOON as the default."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Plan"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"in_progress"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":0},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agents","api","formats","json","markdown","quality","raw","read-only","table","toon","yaml"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-05T20:20:16.290Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-05T20:20:16.290Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/assignee","value":"codex-jellyfin-format-20260805"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex-jellyfin-format-20260805"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":900},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Every leaf command that advertises or inherits format selection honors toon json yaml markdown table and raw through one typed output boundary; TOON remains the default and preserves existing normalized envelopes; JSON stdout parses for every covered command and formatter schemas round-trip; mutation commands are tested only against isolated fixtures and live Jellyfin testing remains read-only; help and documentation describe exact output behavior; release validation PM validation security privacy review and auto-release readiness gates pass"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/definition_of_ready","value":"All 46 PM items and histories inspected at project/relevant-detail level; all-status duplicate and graph audits clean; latest pm-cli and pm-changelog verified; clean main; official release and live server both 10.11.11; defect reproduced without exposing private data."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"jf-mqpo"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Make jf-cli dependable in jq, CI, YAML, Markdown, and agent pipelines instead of silently returning the wrong serialization."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Removes a repo-wide automation footgun across hundreds of dedicated Jellyfin commands and all supported output consumers."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"A single enforceable structured-output contract across the complete dedicated command surface with read-only live proof."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The newest API coverage tranche proved endpoint reach, but direct live probes show the dedicated interface still violates its advertised serialization contract."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"jf-gn5j"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reviewer","value":"github-review-bots"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/sprint","value":"jellyfin-10.11.11"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/release","value":"next-manual-release"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"jf-59hr","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-08-05T20:20:16.290Z","author":"codex-jellyfin-format-20260805","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"jf-644n","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-08-05T20:20:16.290Z","author":"codex-jellyfin-format-20260805","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"jf-935b","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-08-05T20:20:16.290Z","author":"codex-jellyfin-fo